    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: <p data-start="310" data-end="577"><strong data-start="310" data-end="333">Multichannel orders</strong><br data-start="333" data-end="336">Your customers place orders by phone, through your field sales representatives, or directly via your online platform. Without a centralized system, orders get lost or duplicated, and your team spends time re-entering data instead of selling.</p><p data-start="579" data-end="779"><strong data-start="579" data-end="602">Complex price lists</strong><br data-start="602" data-end="605">Each professional customer has their own pricing conditions — negotiated discounts, special prices, currencies. Managing them manually creates errors and commercial friction.</p><p data-start="781" data-end="972"><strong data-start="781" data-end="817">Stock management &amp; replenishment</strong><br data-start="817" data-end="820">With high volumes and multiple suppliers, anticipating stockouts without a centralized tool is costly in terms of lost sales and dissatisfied customers.</p><p data-start="974" data-end="1147"><strong data-start="974" data-end="1008">After-sales service management</strong><br data-start="1008" data-end="1011">Tracking returns, complaints, and exchanges from professional customers while keeping a clear view of order history is a daily headache.</p><p data-start="1149" data-end="1361"><strong data-start="1149" data-end="1171">Sales KPI tracking</strong><br data-start="1171" data-end="1174">Without a centralized dashboard, it is impossible to know which customers, products, or sales representatives are truly performing. Decisions are made based on intuition rather than data.</p>
